# Line endings.
#
# Every text file is stored and checked out with LF, whatever operating system
# the contributor uses. The project runs on Linux everywhere that matters —
# CI, the Docker images, and AWS later — so LF is the native format, and
# fixing it here means the result no longer depends on how each person's
# Git happens to be configured.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Windows-only scripts are the exception: cmd.exe and older PowerShell expect
# CRLF.
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.ps1 text eol=crlf

# Binary files are never touched.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.pdf binary
